  triage:closedNote "AN6-QA-5 (894e36781846): inline PyTuple literal removed from line 179 -- this specific occurrence is fixed, but the underlying identities-checker violation moved to a new const definition (see occurrence 2). AN6-RULE008-003-FIX-1 (const TEST_ANALYST_TEAM: &str = 'atm-dev') relabeled rather than fixed the finding: .just/check_test_identity_literals.py flags any string-literal content matching forbidden_literals regardless of the const/variable name wrapping it." ;
